TEXT -848 168 Left 2 ;So the problem seem to be with the gate drive:\n \nI managed to set the low level so high that it partially turns the FET off during the transient,\nkicking the LC formed by the load and the gate capacitance again and again, leading to\noscillation. If you don't do that however, the turn-on transient ends up overshooting\nthe current source.
